      "en_original": "But we admired Miki so much...and seeing her do this destroyed the image we had of her. It was rough.",
      "en_auxiliary": "But we admired Miki so much...and seeing her do this destroyed the image we had of her. It was rough.",
      "en": "We were the ones who chose to admire her,<CR>then got disillusioned on our own. That's all this was.",
      "alignment": {
