      "en_original": "I don't know if she ever wanted us to admire her. Maybe she even found our adoration exhausting.",
      "en_auxiliary": "I don't know if she ever wanted us to admire her. Maybe she even found our adoration exhausting.",
      "en": "Miki-senpai probably never asked to be seen that way.<CR>Maybe she got tired of everyone expecting so much from her.",
      "alignment": {
        "status": "exact_index_msg_id",
